shape: sequence_diagram

IDP: Azure DevOps\nImage Deployment Pipeline
Azure: Azure\nAME tenant
Vault: KeyVault
Dotcom: Dotcom API
IMS: IMS API

IDP -> Azure: Build image
Azure -> IDP: read-only SAS URL of image
IDP -> Vault: Pull secrets
Vault -> IDP: HMAC for image uploading
IDP -> Dotcom: Call Internal REST API using\nHMAC for image uploading
Dotcom."If 'source_vhd_url' doesn't pointto known\nAME storage account, fail request "
Dotcom -> IMS: Call IMS API
IMS -> Dotcom: Success response
Dotcom -> IDP: Success response
